prompts.short:
Above are today's AI news reports and X threads, plus the episode you just wrote around today's non-obvious insight. Now make a ~60-second vertical video short (about 130-160 spoken words) built around that insight.

Return only JSON in this shape (the "say" lines are the narration; each beat is one on-screen card):
{"slug":"3-5-word-kebab","title":"one-line title","credit":"source outlet name(s) for the on-screen credit","source_url":"main source URL","beats":[{"say":"...","kicker":"1-3 words","headline":"short card headline","figure":"key figure or null","icon":"one of chart, chip, lock, shield, building, robot, doc, globe, bolt, dollar, question"}]}
